    L4.selected_expert: selected_expert
    L4.expert_execution: expert_execution (CPU under -cmoe)
    L5: kernels_runtime
    L5.cpu: cpu
    L5.gpu: gpu
    M: memory_state
    M.expert_weight_range: expert_weight_range
    M.read_request: read_request
    M.readiness: readiness before demand fill
    M.page_cache: page_cache
    M.memory_budget: memory_budget
  observation_point: A named stderr line and field at an engine boundary.
  quantity: A value with unit, phase and region; absence is not zero.
  observation: Measured value with raw evidence provenance.
  assessment: Interpretation under a contract and its limitations.
  claim: A bounded statement supported by observations and assessment.
  capabilities: [expert_streaming.demand_fill, expert_streaming.predictive_read, expert_streaming.readiness_observation, expert_streaming.phase_observation, expert_streaming.worker_naming, expert_streaming.duplicate_read_elimination, expert_streaming.mmap_advice, expert_streaming.router_prefetch]
  notes: Engine request scheduler is distinct from the factory job scheduler; -cmoe executes experts on CPU.
